# AK_Garage_Chrome
# Automotive and industrial interiors. Cools the concrete and steel, controls the blowout on chrome and paint highlights, and holds skin warm and separate from a cold background.
# Best for: Garages, workshops, showrooms, car builds, warehouse walkthroughs.
# Apply AFTER a D-Log M -> Rec.709 conversion, not instead of one.
